   "The award (24Q to fewer than 45Q units) was matched to the Certificate of Achievement-Advanced (Total Required: 40 quarter units). The preceding section ending 'Total Required: 20 Units' (with List B) is a smaller certificate and was not read.",
   "List A (24 units) is recorded as one choose_units block; the catalog divides it into area sub-lists with per-area caps: African American Area (0-24), Asian American Area (0-24), Chicano Area (0-20), Latin American Area (0-8), Multicultural Area (0-24), Native American Area (0-24). Courses are listed in catalog order across areas.",
   "HIST 18A and HIST 18B are printed as cross-lists of AFAM 12A/12B and are not in the closed list; marked catalog_addition.",
